Command:        MEGAMAIL
Purpose:        Send mail to every user.
Available at:   Main menu or all prompts system-wide.
Author:         Phil Beazley (Midnight) of Autumn's Harvest Inn
                BBS: 910-326-3804; FidoNet: 1:3614/118; C-Link! 911:6380/7
                UUCP: beazleyp@mqg-smtp3.usmc.mil

Using this utility instead of CNet's built-in multi-mail command allows
the SysOp and users an easy alternative to sending mail to every user.

Simply enter a subject, answer the few questions (about return-receipts
and return of original), write your mail and BOOM, MegaMail sends the
mail to every user and notifies you of the number of actual recipients.
